# Three card types is not delirium (CR 207.2c): Bot1's graveyard holds the Wurm, a Forest and Wheel of Fortune (creature, land, sorcery) while Bot2's has an artifact too -
# only your own graveyard counts - so with all {2}{G}{G} available and an empty stack the Wurm can't be brought back.

